  abilityDesc: 22 combo powerful Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), hugely boosts Spark damage for 3 turns, boosts Spark damage for Earth types
    for 3 turns, Spark damage considerably boosts BB gauge for 3 turns, enormously
    boosts Earth elemental damage for 3 turns & probable 1 turn huge Atk reduction
